      "card": {
        "identifier": "JUL-255",
        "state": "Ready",
        "description": "## Agent Brief\n\n**Category:** enhancement / machine-proof fixture\n\n**Summary:** Prove the cleaned JUL-253 candidate through the real Tailscale Start page while retaining JUL-254 unchanged as evidence.\n\n**Current behavior:** The cleaned candidate has no fresh practice build proving a complete Start journey. JUL-254 records the two earlier failed attempts and must not be reused or changed.\n\n**Desired behavior:** Create `JUL-253-START-PRACTICE-2.txt` containing exactly `Julia cleaned Start proof.` followed by one newline, with that marker as the practice candidate's only repository change.\n\n**Key interfaces:**\n\n`JUL-253-START-PRACTICE-2.txt` is the requested output. The real server Start page supplies the saved card and selected model roles to the machine.\n\n**Acceptance criteria:**\n\n* The real control page admits this Ready card and Start is clicked at `https://ovh.tail91f394.ts.net/julia-control`.\n* The saved snapshot uses ChatGPT-plan Sol for orchestration and CommandCode DeepSeek for coding.\n* The build finishes with a clean, nonempty candidate commit whose only change is the exact marker.\n* The card's shared ledger contains settled Sol and DeepSeek requests with provider usage and API-equivalent debits under its own $2 cap.\n* Start response, browser network and console record, screenshots, receipt, exact commit, ledger rows, and marker readback are retained on `build/jul-253`.\n\n**Proof:** Drive the real Tailscale page with installed Playwright, wait for the build to finish, and bind every artifact to the exact candidate and practice-card identifier.\n\n**Out of scope:** Do not merge or publish the marker, modify JUL-254, reset accounting, raise the cap, or silently retry under another card.\n\n**Authorization:** Todd approved creation and Ready transition for this practice card on 23 October 2026. Practice cards may be created and moved to Ready without another approval. This card has its own $2 budget.",
        "frameworkMaps": [],
        "title": "Practice cleaned JUL-253 through server Start"
      }
    }
  ],
